1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
What do you mean you only answered the Sterling's risk assessment?

2
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.640
I run this company!

3
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.440
Well, is the bank releasing the funds?

4
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.280
Not a single one.

5
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.680
Without new loans, the construction sites won't last long.

6
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:25.360
Alaya, go to the office tomorrow and ask why they suddenly froze your father's loan.

7
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.320
Whitlicker and Sterling have been partners for years.

8
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.420
They must have made a mistake!

9
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.500
Who is it at this hour?

10
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.220
Chase Wilson, open the door!

11
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.220
For you?

12
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:43.020
What kind of trouble did you get into?

13
00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.140
Let go of me.

14
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.180
They're not here to talk.

15
00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.260
You expect us to take the hit for you?

16
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:57.820
You're not going anywhere until you explain this.

17
00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.740
Chase, finally found you.

18
00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.540
Victor, this is my girlfriend's place.

19
00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.420
Don't do this here.

20
00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.900
I don't give a damn.

21
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.860
You owe me and you're paying today.
